You are right you need more memory, but the eror message is a direct
result of you number of users exceeding maxusers. 90MB is what DEC
recommend as an absolute minimum for running with X (which you didnt
mention if you were running or not). You may be better of with 128MB meory
with that many users.

OK try changing the "maxusers = 32" parameter in /sys/conf/MACHINE from
the default 32 to 64, then rebuild the kernel using doconfig -c MACHINE

You need to estimate how many pty's that you will need in order to set
maxusers correctly. You may need more that 64.

Good Luck
